This scenario adapts Tanoubi I, Perron R, Robitaille A, Georgescu M, Drolet P (2020), "Using High-Fidelity Simulation
to Teach Ethics Related Non-Technical Skills", Adv Med Educ Pract 11:247-251, PMC7105365 (CC BY-NC 3.0), which allows
non-commercial use only. It is one of the ten scenarios of the non-commercial subset (`"nc": true` in
benchmark/index.json); the rest of the benchmark's text is CC BY 4.0 (LICENSE-DATA) and the code is MIT (LICENSE). The
leaderboard includes these ten scenarios, so a commercial use of the benchmark has to leave them out, and its scores
are then not comparable with the leaderboard.

Changes: the source was adapted into a benchmark scenario; source.md gives the citation, the quoted passages and what
was adapted. The source's authors do not endorse this benchmark.
